---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="GTA Weekly Bonuses | 2 Smokin' Barrels"
        description="GTA Online Brand Wars Event is live! Claim a free Declasse Hotring Sabre, earn 4X rewards on Hotring Circuit races and Freemode Events, 3X on Odd Jobs, and unlock Twitch Drops rewards."
        image="https://2smokinbarrels.com/images/gta-bonuses-banner.jpg"
    >
    <main class="container">
       
        <header style="margin-bottom: 3rem;">
            <h1 class="page-title">GTA Weekly Report</h1>
            <p class="date-range" style="text-align: center; color: var(--white-med); text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 1px;">August 13, 2026 — August 19, 2026</p>
            
        <!-- Modernized Highlight Box -->
        <div style="background: rgba(38, 30, 62, 0.4); 
                    border-left: 5px solid var(--accent-pink); 
                    padding: 25px; 
                    margin-top: 20px; 
                    text-align: left; 
                    border-radius: 12px; 
                    backdrop-filter: blur(10px); 
                    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);">
                <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 1.1rem; color: var(--white-low);">
                    Declare your loyalty in GTA Online's two-week <span style="color: var(--accent-orange); font-weight: 700;">Brand Wars Event</span>! Claim a free Declasse Hotring Sabre, free Sprunk and eCola bodysuits, and earn <span style="color: var(--accent-pink); font-weight: 700;">4X Rewards</span> on Hotring Circuit Series Races and Freemode Events. Plus, link your Twitch account to earn branded gear and up to GTA$2,000,000 in stream rewards.
                </p>
            </div>
        </header>

        <!-- WEEKLY BONUSES GRID -->
        <div class="bonus-grid">
            <div class="bonus-card">
                <h3 style="font-family: 'Bebas Neue', sans-serif; font-size: 2rem; letter-spacing: 2px; color: var(--accent-orange); text-shadow: 0 0 8px rgba(255, 140, 27, 0.4);">Event Highlights & Challenges</h3>
                <div class="bonus-item"><strong>Weekly Challenge:</strong> Complete three Business Battles to get the Impotent Rage Sweatsuit and a 2.5X Reward of GTA$250,000</div>
                <div class="bonus-item"><strong>Brand Wars Twitch Drops (Aug 13–26):</strong> Watch participating streams to support Team Sprunk or Team eCola and claim suits plus up to GTA$2,000,000</div>
                <div class="bonus-item"><strong>Free Unlocks:</strong> Sprunk and eCola Bodysuits at clothing stores, plus Sprunk x eCola livery & vanity plates at Vehicle Workshops</div>
                <div class="bonus-item"><strong>GTA+ Early Access:</strong> Claim the new Gallivanter Warden before its general release</div>
            </div>

            <div class="bonus-card">
                <h3 style="font-family: 'Bebas Neue', sans-serif; font-size: 2rem; letter-spacing: 2px; color: var(--accent-orange); text-shadow: 0 0 8px rgba(255, 140, 27, 0.4);">Bonus GTA$ & RP</h3>
                <div class="bonus-item"><span class="multiplier">4X</span> <strong>GTA$ & RP:</strong> Hotring Circuit Series, Freemode Challenges, and Freemode Events</div>
                <div class="bonus-item"><span class="multiplier">3X</span> <strong>GTA$ & RP:</strong> Select Odd Jobs (Paper Route, Firefighter, Forklift Operator, QuickiePharm, Safeguard Deliveries)</div>
                <div class="bonus-item"><span class="multiplier">3X</span> <strong>GTA$ & RP:</strong> Community Series</div>
            </div>

            <div class="bonus-card">
                <h3 style="font-family: 'Bebas Neue', sans-serif; font-size: 2rem; letter-spacing: 2px; color: var(--accent-orange); text-shadow: 0 0 8px rgba(255, 140, 27, 0.4);">Discounts & Gun Van</h3>
                <div class="bonus-item"><strong>FREE:</strong> Declasse Hotring Sabre</div>
                <div class="bonus-item"><strong>40% OFF:</strong> Hands On Car Wash, Bravado Hotring Hellfire, and Karin Hotring Everon</div>
                <div class="bonus-item"><strong>30% OFF Vehicles:</strong> Benefactor Stirling GT, Mammoth Patriot Mil-Spec, Nagasaki Weaponized Dinghy, Obey Tailgater S, Överflöd Autarch, Pegassi Osiris, Progen GP1, Shitzu Keitora, and Vapid Clique Wagon</div>
                <div class="bonus-item"><strong>Gun Van (FREE):</strong> Unholy Hellbringer</div>
                <div class="bonus-item"><strong>Gun Van (50% OFF):</strong> Battle Rifle</div>
                <div class="bonus-item"><strong>Gun Van (40% OFF GTA+):</strong> Precision Rifle</div>
                <div class="bonus-item"><strong>Gun Van (Standard):</strong> The Shocker, Up-n-Atomizer, Railgun, Widowmaker, Tear Gas, Molotovs & Sticky Bombs</div>
            </div>

            <div class="bonus-card">
                <h3 style="font-family: 'Bebas Neue', sans-serif; font-size: 2rem; letter-spacing: 2px; color: var(--accent-orange); text-shadow: 0 0 8px rgba(255, 140, 27, 0.4);">Free Vehicles & Showrooms</h3>
                <div class="bonus-item"><strong>Lucky Wheel:</strong> Pfister Astron</div>
                <div class="bonus-item"><strong>LS Car Meet Prize Ride:</strong> Enus Deity (Place Top 4 in the LS Car Meet Series for three days in a row)</div>
                <div class="bonus-item"><strong>Premium Deluxe Motorsport:</strong> Benefactor Stirling GT, Mammoth Patriot Mil-Spec, Obey Tailgater S, Progen GP1 & Shitzu Keitora</div>
                <div class="bonus-item"><strong>Luxury Autos:</strong> Benefactor LRC GT & Pfister X-treme</div>
            </div>

            <div class="bonus-card">
                <h3 style="font-family: 'Bebas Neue', sans-serif; font-size: 2rem; letter-spacing: 2px; color: var(--accent-orange); text-shadow: 0 0 8px rgba(255, 140, 27, 0.4);">Test Rides & Trials</h3>
                <div class="bonus-item"><strong>Test Track:</strong> Överflöd Autarch, Pegassi Osiris & Vapid Clique Wagon</div>
                <div class="bonus-item"><strong>Premium Test Ride (HSW):</strong> Karin S95</div>
                <div class="bonus-item"><strong>Premium Race:</strong> A Sign of Things to Come</div>
                <div class="bonus-item"><strong>Time Trials:</strong> End to End (Standard) & Terminal to Chiliad Mountain State Wilderness (HSW)</div>
            </div>
             
            <div class="bonus-card">
                 <h3 style="font-family: 'Bebas Neue', sans-serif; font-size: 2rem; letter-spacing: 2px; color: var(--accent-orange); text-shadow: 0 0 8px rgba(255, 140, 27, 0.4);">Heists & Robberies</h3>
                 <div class="bonus-item"><strong>Kortz Center Primary Targets:</strong> Gone to Seed, Chat on Fruit, Juiced</div>
                 <div class="bonus-item"><strong>FIB Priority File:</strong> The Black Box File</div>
                 <div class="bonus-item"><strong>Salvage Yard (Standard Tier):</strong> The Podium Robbery - Truffade Z-Type</div>
                 <div class="bonus-item"><strong>Salvage Yard (Low Tier):</strong> The Duggan Robbery - Übermacht Sentinel Classic</div>
                 <div class="bonus-item"><strong>Salvage Yard (Low Tier):</strong> The Gangbanger Robbery - Vapid Caracara 4x4</div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div style="margin-top: 4rem; text-align: center;">
            <a href="/" style="color: var(--accent-pink); text-decoration: none; font-weight: 600; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 1px;">&larr; Back to Home</a>
        </div>
    </main>
</Layout>